abstract: >-
  A reference implementation for Clean AI Engineering: a customer-support agent for a clothing e-commerce site, built without an agent framework as one module per AI Harness Catalog layer, with the architecture enforced by build-time checks and the agent exercised against AgentTwin worlds.
